{
  "chapter.4755484EAFF30E44.title": "&5Tales of the Guh End",
  "chapter.4755484EAFF30E44.chapter_subtitle": [
    "3. Overlord Mika has all the nibbles, nyeg!",
  ],
  "task.475548837D6916B0.title": "The Lord of the Nibble Ring",
  "task.47554864DEB36D85.title": "Super Guhrio",
  "task.475548993527E0BB.title": "Beat the Burnt Mika",
  "quest.4755482CB82CCF3D.title": "Lock: The Guhbarbecuether First",
  "quest.4755482CB82CCF3D.quest_desc": [
    "&cThis chapter is locked.&r The portal in the Nibble Cellar won't let you through until you've followed &6The Lord of the Nibble Ring&r and &cSuper Guhrio&r and have beaten the &cBurnt Mika&r. Below you can see what you already have: one tick per thing.",
    "",
    "Have you been to the Guh End before? Whoever is still there may stay, but whoever steps out follows the rest of the Guh Path first. Everything you've already done simply stays saved, nyeg.",
    "",
    "This story starts with two quests in &dThe Guhmension&r: &cThe Bigger the Mika...&r (Mikas, especially Big Mika, cry &5Mika Tears&r: you need those for the Eyes of Chonky) and &dLong Live the King!&r (the King Guh in the Guh Castle tells you where all the cheese nibbles went).",
    "",
    "After that: twelve Eyes of Chonky, the Nibble Cellar and... Overlord Mika. Without nibbles your guh isn't WAHOOG, so go get them back! More stories will be added here later.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F95D32C0F4.title": "A Mika Cries",
  "quest.475548F95D32C0F4.quest_desc": [
    "The Mikas snatch up all the cheese nibbles... but sometimes they cry, too. Defeat Mikas (Big Mika cries the loudest) or beat the Mika Boss three times with CHONK for a &5Mika Tear&r.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484A511D2B07.title": "A Royal Mission",
  "quest.4755484A511D2B07.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to a wild &dKing Guh&r on his throne in the Guh Castle. He tells you where all the nibbles went. Nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480BF2E8ECFD.title": "Twelve Eyes of Chonky",
  "quest.4755480BF2E8ECFD.quest_desc": [
    "Guh Crystal + cheese nibble + Mika Tear + grill skewer powder (from the Skewer Keep in the Barbecuether) = an &6Eye of Chonky&r. You need twelve for the portal (and a few extra to throw, because sometimes they go &5nyeg&r and break).",
  ],
  "quest.475548E52AC6A515.title": "The Nibble Cellar",
  "quest.475548E52AC6A515.quest_desc": [
    "Throw an Eye of Chonky in the Guhmension and follow it. Does it dive down? Start digging! Or use the Super Compass (End).",
  ],
  "quest.4755482A87ECB0FE.title": "Guh Liberator",
  "quest.4755482A87ECB0FE.quest_desc": [
    "In the cells of the Nibble Cellar sit gray, skinny guhs. Give them a cheese nibble and they're WAHOOG again right away! Rescue six.",
  ],
  "quest.47554894C6AA450A.title": "Twelve Eyes",
  "quest.47554894C6AA450A.quest_desc": [
    "Put an Eye of Chonky in each of the twelve Nibble Portal Frames in the portal room. Watch out for the Mika Grubs! The portal only lets you through once you have beaten the &6Burnt Mika&r in the Barbecuether.",
  ],
  "quest.475548048B20D10A.title": "The Guh End",
  "quest.475548048B20D10A.quest_desc": [
    "Jump into the portal. Welcome to the Guh End: an island of cheese rind, high above the nothingness. Where did all those nibbles go?",
  ],
  "quest.4755486B3BEC166E.title": "Nibbles Back!",
  "quest.4755486B3BEC166E.quest_desc": [
    "On top of the cheese pillars sit Nibble Crystals full of stolen nibbles: they heal Overlord Mika. Shoot them to bits (or climb up)!",
  ],
  "quest.475548BB4CB92BB5.title": "A Nibble for the Enderguh",
  "quest.475548BB4CB92BB5.quest_desc": [
    "Are all the crystals broken? Then the worn-out Enderguh lands on Nibble Mountain. Give it a cheese nibble: WAHOOG!",
  ],
  "quest.4755488B952685DE.title": "OVER-CHONKED!",
  "quest.4755488B952685DE.quest_desc": [
    "Defeat Overlord Mika on foot. Watch out: he snatches your nibbles, makes grease puddles and calls Mika helpers. He drops everything when you win!",
  ],
  "quest.4755481C395DF146.title": "Your Own Wahoog Enderguh",
  "quest.4755481C395DF146.quest_desc": [
    "After your first victory you get the freed Enderguh as a mount. Hop on and fly! (Later you get Enderguh Eggs.)",
  ],
  "quest.4755485F779FAD61.title": "Knight of the Guh End",
  "quest.4755485F779FAD61.quest_desc": [
    "Go back to the King Guh and get knighted. Kneel!",
  ],
  "quest.47554812E1FEE001.title": "Overlord Mika's Nibble Hoard",
  "quest.47554812E1FEE001.quest_desc": [
    "After the first victory, the nibble hoard under Nibble Mountain opens up. Walk to the south side of the mountain!",
  ],
  "quest.4755484F0E1FD4F4.title": "Enderguh",
  "quest.4755484F0E1FD4F4.quest_desc": [
    "Get close to an &dEnderguh&r (within 3 blocks) so it goes into your Guhdex. It lives in the Guh End: you only see it after beating Overlord Mika!",
  ],
  "quest.47554801DEE1F937.title": "Dragon Buddy",
  "quest.47554801DEE1F937.quest_desc": [
    "Tame an &5Enderguh&r. They live in the Guh End and only let themselves be tamed once you have beaten Overlord Mika: 1 in 8 cheese nibbles, or all at once with a fried cheese nibble.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D682B03811.title": "Chonk Flight",
  "quest.475548D682B03811.quest_desc": [
    "Saddle your Enderguh and fly! Look where you want to go, W = forward, space = up. Flying only works once you have beaten Overlord Mika.",
  ],
  "quest.4755489D1C3345E2.title": "Through the Nibble Gate",
  "quest.4755489D1C3345E2.quest_desc": [
    "After every victory a Nibble Gate appears around the island. Jump in: it flings you to the outer islands.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480846A343A2.title": "A Mika Fortress",
  "quest.4755480846A343A2.quest_desc": [
    "On the outer islands stand Mika Fortresses made of purple Mika Stone, full of Mikas and loot.",
  ],
  "quest.47554832292EA215.title": "Guh Wings!",
  "quest.47554832292EA215.quest_desc": [
    "A Mika Fortress often has a greasy Mika grease ship moored to it. The &dGuh Wings&r hang on board: off you glide!",
  ],
  "quest.47554821BCBB035E.title": "Toot Toot, Back to the Middle",
  "quest.47554821BCBB035E.quest_desc": [
    "All over the outer islands there are &dReturn Gates&r: little gates with a guh head on top. Step in and you float wahoog-ly back to the big island.",
  ],
  "quest.47554806041E9EFE.title": "One More Round",
  "quest.47554806041E9EFE.quest_desc": [
    "Place four Nibble Crystals on the four Nibble Pedestals around the return portal and Overlord Mika comes back. Defeat him again for an Enderguh Egg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548C7558482E0.title": "The Cheese Ball",
  "quest.475548C7558482E0.quest_desc": [
    "Whoever has beaten Overlord Mika sees a &6glowing cheese ball&r wash up at the Nibble Mountain. Tap it open and see who was inside.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A9701734ED.title": "Yip Yip!",
  "quest.475548A9701734ED.quest_desc": [
    "Fly on &dAppa Guh&r to the &bSouthern Air Temple&r. No need to search: he knows the way.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481AEA21FDF5.title": "The Hall of the Guhvatars",
  "quest.4755481AEA21FDF5.quest_desc": [
    "The hall holds the statues of every Guhvatar before you. Two of them have something to tell you.",
  ],
  "quest.47554839AA2D25C8.title": "Airball",
  "quest.47554839AA2D25C8.quest_desc": [
    "Play airball against &dAang Guh&r on the poles. Guhatso is the referee. First to three!",
  ],
  "quest.4755482D09C7C42F.title": "The Air Scooter Track",
  "quest.4755482D09C7C42F.quest_desc": [
    "Step on the line under the start arch and race all the way round the track on an air scooter before the time runs out. Whoooosh!",
  ],
  "quest.475548BD32FFB82C.title": "Gliding",
  "quest.475548BD32FFB82C.quest_desc": [
    "Jump off the south balcony at the top of the Great Tower and glide through the six rings. You may miss one.",
  ],
  "quest.47554888BF921F00.title": "After Momo",
  "quest.47554888BF921F00.quest_desc": [
    "A glowing lemur guh snatches your nibble. Follow him and his trail of little clouds through the temple, up the towers and over the bridges.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BCD2AA528A.title": "Appa's Stable",
  "quest.475548BCD2AA528A.quest_desc": [
    "Take the saddle in Appa's stable, put it on Appa and feed him three apples. A happy Appa is a flying Appa.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480446808BF8.title": "Not Finished Yet",
  "quest.4755480446808BF8.quest_desc": [
    "Behind a closed door someone is tinkering. Who? You'll hear. Or rather: you won't hear yet.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B7ECBA1C3E.title": "Finally, the Guhvatar",
  "quest.475548B7ECBA1C3E.quest_desc": [
    "A Fire Nation ship rams the jetty. Escape on Appa and learn airbending: the first of the four elements!",
  ],
  "quest.47554818784F7192.title": "The Northern Water Tribe",
  "quest.47554818784F7192.quest_desc": [
    "Fly with &dAppa&r to the &6Northern Water Tribe&r: a city of ice and canals behind a giant ice wall. The gate guard guh is strict, but very friendly once you wipe your paws.",
  ],
  "quest.47554882EDE700F2.title": "A Moustache, Please",
  "quest.47554882EDE700F2.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to &dMaster Pakguh&r on the training square. He only teaches guhs with a moustache. Luckily &dKatara Guh&r is there too.",
  ],
  "quest.475548053FBAF427.title": "The Water Whip",
  "quest.475548053FBAF427.quest_desc": [
    "Hit the &6five targets&r on the training square with your power &bWater Whip&r (the power key).",
  ],
  "quest.475548C3DDB96B7A.title": "Waves, Not Splashes",
  "quest.475548C3DDB96B7A.quest_desc": [
    "Make &6three waves&r in the wave pool next to the square with &bWater Wave&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548352E8F0A9E.title": "The Ice Bridge",
  "quest.475548352E8F0A9E.quest_desc": [
    "Stand at the end of the jetty, look at the islet and freeze a bridge with &bIce Bridge&r. Then walk across.",
  ],
  "quest.475548377CF07D17.title": "Otter Surfing",
  "quest.475548377CF07D17.quest_desc": [
    "Climb the ice wall left of the gate. Step onto the &dotter-penguin guh&r at the Slide Pulpit with an empty paw and slide down.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484FD8C1D113.title": "The Gondola",
  "quest.4755484FD8C1D113.quest_desc": [
    "Get into the gondola in the basin below the grand stairs and push it past the &6three stops&r with &bWater Current&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548CD0DCFB668.title": "Princess Yue Guh",
  "quest.475548CD0DCFB668.quest_desc": [
    "Pay &dPrincess Yue Guh&r a visit in the palace. &dSokka Guh&r comes along. By coincidence.",
  ],
  "quest.47554876D9117935.title": "Smoke Above the Sea",
  "quest.47554876D9117935.quest_desc": [
    "Go to the harbor, to &cZhao Mika&r's ship. Watch out for nets.",
  ],
  "quest.47554858C3983DE7.title": "The Blue Spirit",
  "quest.47554858C3983DE7.quest_desc": [
    "Someone in a blue mask untied you. Sneak off the ship. Stay out of the guards' light.",
  ],
  "quest.47554834E0FDC094.title": "The Moon Fish",
  "quest.47554834E0FDC094.quest_desc": [
    "Go to the &6spirit oasis&r behind the palace, through the little door in the ice.",
  ],
  "quest.47554877FCB1E593.title": "Meditation",
  "quest.47554877FCB1E593.quest_desc": [
    "Sit down by the pond (sneak) and meditate with &dAang Guh&r. Beware of wrong dimensions.",
  ],
  "quest.475548C4C3942FDD.title": "Show No Emotion",
  "quest.475548C4C3942FDD.quest_desc": [
    "Find &dKoh the Face Stealer&r in the Spirit World. When he looks at you: don't move, don't jump, don't click anything.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481C5436C7EC.title": "The Sky Pond",
  "quest.4755481C5436C7EC.quest_desc": [
    "Go to the &6Sky Pond&r, where Tui and La should be swimming. Only one of them is.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A06C4A2DF3.title": "Bringing Tui Back",
  "quest.475548A06C4A2DF3.quest_desc": [
    "Sneak aboard &cZhao Mika&r's ship and take the moon fish out of the cage in the hold.",
  ],
  "quest.47554824937D9A6D.title": "The Moon",
  "quest.47554824937D9A6D.quest_desc": [
    "Bring the moon fish back to the pond in the oasis. &dYue Guh&r is waiting there.",
  ],
  "quest.475548284C705674.title": "The Great Wave",
  "quest.475548284C705674.quest_desc": [
    "Climb to the &6Wave Pulpit&r above the gate. The ocean is waiting. Gently, right?",
  ],
  "quest.475548C02FD04BE1.title": "The Blizzard",
  "quest.475548C02FD04BE1.quest_desc": [
    "Follow the little light through the storm. Listen for &dAppa&r. Then chapter 2 is done: &dKatara Guh&r and &dSokka Guh&r travel with you.",
  ],
  "quest.47554889B2CF7719.title": "Ba Sing Guh",
  "quest.47554889B2CF7719.quest_desc": [
    "After the Water Tribe, Appa Guh flies you to the Earth Kingdom. Land on the landing lobe in front of the enormous outer wall of &6Ba Sing Guh&r. The story starts by itself.",
  ],
  "quest.475548705EE469FC.title": "Passport, please",
  "quest.475548705EE469FC.quest_desc": [
    "Nobody gets in without a stamp. Talk to the &dstrict desk guh&r in the gate building and answer his questions. Every answer is fine. Really.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480E121C1882.title": "The Earth Rumble",
  "quest.4755480E121C1882.quest_desc": [
    "There's fighting in the Lower Ring. Nobody gets hurt, just a little pebbled. Go to the arena in the southwest.",
  ],
  "quest.475548551324C288.title": "Seeing with your feet",
  "quest.475548551324C288.quest_desc": [
    "&dToph Guh&r, The Blind Bandit, teaches you earthbending: with your eyes closed. Find the six earth coins in her training course. Crouching is stomping.",
  ],
  "quest.475548C1090ADAB6.title": "The monorail",
  "quest.475548C1090ADAB6.quest_desc": [
    "Take the monorail from the outer wall to the Middle Ring. Every jump is a push with earthbending.",
  ],
  "quest.475548312D6883B4.title": "The Jasmine Dragon",
  "quest.475548312D6883B4.quest_desc": [
    "Somewhere in the Middle Ring it smells of jasmine. Find &dUncle Miroh&r's tea house. The waiter is... grumpy.",
  ],
  "quest.4755486207C044D9.title": "Patience in a cup",
  "quest.4755486207C044D9.quest_desc": [
    "Make tea at the big kettle: water, leaves, pouring. Each time click right on time.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BA2CF7E327.title": "A game of Pai Sho",
  "quest.475548BA2CF7E327.quest_desc": [
    "Take turns laying a tile. Whoever lays a lotus first wins. Win or not: Uncle Miroh has something to say.",
  ],
  "quest.47554869E62D4E81.title": "No nibble shortage",
  "quest.47554869E62D4E81.quest_desc": [
    "&dJoo Dee Guh&r shows you the city. She smiles a lot.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A1AFBC1C26.title": "Appa's Lost Days",
  "quest.475548A1AFBC1C26.quest_desc": [
    "Go back to the camp. Something isn't right.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E5D95592E9.title": "The Earth King",
  "quest.475548E5D95592E9.quest_desc": [
    "Maybe the &dEarth King Guh&r knows something. Or his bear Bosco.",
  ],
  "quest.47554821B209F985.title": "Lake Laogai",
  "quest.47554821B209F985.quest_desc": [
    "Sneak into the base under the lake. Getting seen = back to the hall, nothing else. Crouching helps.",
  ],
  "quest.475548725E4BDD62.title": "A Song for Lu Ten",
  "quest.475548725E4BDD62.quest_desc": [
    "Uncle Miroh isn't in his tea house. Find the hill with the cherry tree.",
  ],
  "quest.475548CF40A57A51.title": "The Fall of Ba Sing Guh",
  "quest.475548CF40A57A51.quest_desc": [
    "The Dai Li took Katara Guh to the crystal catacombs under the palace.",
  ],
  "quest.4755489691C7FA24.title": "A new team member",
  "quest.4755489691C7FA24.quest_desc": [
    "At the camp someone is waiting with her feet in the grass. Then: on to the Fire Nation.",
  ],
  "quest.475548835D6D9A9D.title": "In disguise in the Fire Nation",
  "quest.475548835D6D9A9D.quest_desc": [
    "Appa-guh carries the team to the capital of the Fire Nation. Red clothes on, ears under a headband: nobody may know who you are.",
  ],
  "quest.4755482FC8904FAA.title": "The little school",
  "quest.4755482FC8904FAA.quest_desc": [
    "Take a seat in a Fire Nation classroom. Who is the best Fire Lord? You already know the answer, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D68D3B9409.title": "The secret dance party",
  "quest.475548D68D3B9409.quest_desc": [
    "Dancing is forbidden in the Fire Nation. In the cave behind the school they do it anyway. Stand on the square that lights up!",
  ],
  "quest.475548371940A5C5.title": "The turtle-duck guhs",
  "quest.475548371940A5C5.quest_desc": [
    "Feed the turtle-duck guhs in the palace pond. They nibble gently. Out of love.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F643FFE2C0.title": "The Day of Black Sun",
  "quest.475548F643FFE2C0.quest_desc": [
    "Eight minutes without fire. The throne room is empty, and deep under the palace Zuka finally says what he thinks.",
  ],
  "quest.475548C1114AC00C.title": "The cell under the palace",
  "quest.475548C1114AC00C.quest_desc": [
    "Follow Zuka to his uncle. Miroh says nothing. But he does do push-ups.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481DEF87598E.title": "A guest in the camp",
  "quest.4755481DEF87598E.quest_desc": [
    "Zuka stands at the edge of the campfire. Nobody trusts him. Toph-guh least of all.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A4E9C6BA06.title": "Making up",
  "quest.475548A4E9C6BA06.quest_desc": [
    "Help Zuka find the right words, for Toph-guh and for Katara-guh.",
  ],
  "quest.475548FB6DD13D31.title": "The Boiling Rock",
  "quest.475548FB6DD13D31.quest_desc": [
    "With Sokka-guh and Zuka to the prison in the boiling lake. Sneak past the guards and free Suki-guh.",
  ],
  "quest.4755489278ED0186.title": "The Dancing Dragon",
  "quest.4755489278ED0186.quest_desc": [
    "Dance for the dragon guhs of the Sun Warriors, step by step. Then you learn what fire really is.",
  ],
  "quest.475548398C88BE7E.title": "The Boy in the Cheese Ball",
  "quest.475548398C88BE7E.quest_desc": [
    "A play about your adventure. It's wrong from start to finish. Watch it anyway.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481FA42DC90A.title": "The tent of the White Lotus",
  "quest.4755481FA42DC90A.quest_desc": [
    "Zuka and Uncle Miroh. A tent, a pot of tea, and a sentence everybody has been waiting for.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483042E6095D.title": "The Peak of the Predecessors",
  "quest.4755483042E6095D.quest_desc": [
    "Fang flies you through the Spirit World to the Guhvatars before you. They have advice. And a few jokes.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A9BBA4973D.title": "The Lion Turtle Guh",
  "quest.475548A9BBA4973D.quest_desc": [
    "You wake up at night on the back of an island. That island has little ears.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485759E156A0.title": "The airship fleet",
  "quest.4755485759E156A0.quest_desc": [
    "Fly on Appa-guh through Mikai's burning airships. The team takes them down, you steer.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BFADB59513.title": "Agni Kai",
  "quest.475548BFADB59513.quest_desc": [
    "Zuka and Azula-Mika on the palace forecourt. Blue fire against red.",
  ],
  "quest.47554894CE5BF026.title": "The duel",
  "quest.47554894CE5BF026.quest_desc": [
    "Four rounds on the rock pillars, one for each element. And then the rock touches your old scar...",
  ],
  "quest.475548756C242427.title": "The coronation",
  "quest.475548756C242427.quest_desc": [
    "A new Fire Lord. Fireworks. Tea.",
  ],
  "quest.47554851C0E1AD79.title": "The Guhvatar",
  "quest.47554851C0E1AD79.quest_desc": [
    "The story has been told. You get your own statue, with glowing eyes.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488CEC34A26C.title": "Another World",
  "quest.4755488CEC34A26C.quest_desc": [
    "Your soul sniffs further than your body: the Spirit World. Islands in the haze, lilac grass, water that falls upwards. You first go there in the story of the Water Tribe.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E095604FDD.title": "Lost Lanterns",
  "quest.475548E095604FDD.quest_desc": [
    "Bring all eight lost little lantern spirits back to the Lantern Tree. Click a lantern and it follows you.",
  ],
  "quest.475548FC54B92300.title": "An Acorn from Home",
  "quest.475548FC54B92300.quest_desc": [
    "Hei Bai Guh is big and angry, because his forest burnt down. Make a Nibble Chorus Acorn and plant it by the burnt stump.",
  ],
  "quest.47554878348BDDEB.title": "No Feelings",
  "quest.47554878348BDDEB.quest_desc": [
    "Answer the three riddles of Koh the Face Stealer. Don't move. Don't jump. Feel nothing.",
  ],
  "quest.47554868937E9EFF.title": "The Gate of the White Lotus",
  "quest.47554868937E9EFF.quest_desc": [
    "Lay the nine turning tiles before the gate as a white lotus, and walk into the court.",
  ],
  "quest.47554854851697D4.title": "Five Masters",
  "quest.47554854851697D4.quest_desc": [
    "Pass the trials of Bumi Guh, Pakguh, Piandao Guh, Jeong Jeong Guh and Uncle Miroh. Every trial gives a Pai Sho tile.",
  ],
  "quest.475548883279F8B9.title": "The White Lotus Tile",
  "quest.475548883279F8B9.quest_desc": [
    "Listen to the old members of the order. The founder gives you the tile that belongs to nobody.",
  ],
  "quest.475548605E9ECEBF.title": "The Old Heron",
  "quest.475548605E9ECEBF.quest_desc": [
    "Lay the six tiles on the pedestals. Something very big wakes up.",
  ],
  "quest.47554832AE162A32.title": "The Lotus Archive",
  "quest.47554832AE162A32.quest_desc": [
    "Maps, songs, recipes. Mostly recipes. Take a book with you.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DB1C0FEC54.title": "Seven Little Gates",
  "quest.475548DB1C0FEC54.quest_desc": [
    "Open the seven chakras, one per zone, with Guru Pathik Guh as your guide. Reward: the Guhvatar glow.",
  ],
  "quest.47554872C6D30D87.title": "Rare Sightings",
  "quest.47554872C6D30D87.quest_desc": [
    "A white heron, a golden knowledge fox, Koh in the mist and a moon night. Look closely: they're gone again in no time.",
  ],
  "quest.475548683696358B.title": "The Spirit Bell",
  "quest.475548683696358B.quest_desc": [
    "Ring the giant bell between the two islands. Then it gets quiet. Very quiet.",
  ],
  "quest.4755482100A4485C.title": "Glowing Paw Prints",
  "quest.4755482100A4485C.quest_desc": [
    "Follow the glowing footsteps of something invisible to three little secrets.",
  ],
  "quest.47554875171DB06C.title": "Still Water",
  "quest.47554875171DB06C.quest_desc": [
    "Look into a mirror pond. The water shows something far away. Or yourself.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483638B9BB2C.title": "Back to the Spirit World",
  "quest.4755483638B9BB2C.quest_desc": [
    "After the whole story you can always go back: sit on a meditation cushion and close your eyes. From a meditation stone you travel (with shift) to buildings you know.",
  ],
  "quest.475548717216D0BE.title": "The First",
  "quest.475548717216D0BE.quest_desc": [
    "A hooded figure watches you, far away. Follow him, until a path appears to the eighth island.",
  ],
  "quest.47554887D6B9327B.title": "A Mad Old King",
  "quest.47554887D6B9327B.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to King Bumi Guh in the throne room of Omashguh.",
  ],
  "quest.4755489CB959FD72.title": "The Key in the Waterfall",
  "quest.4755489CB959FD72.quest_desc": [
    "Get the key out of the waterfall of glass (trial 1). Climbing won't work: use your earth power in the room.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E2084227C9.title": "Where Is Flopsie?",
  "quest.475548E2084227C9.quest_desc": [
    "Find Flopsie, the king's pet. The hutch of trial 2 is awfully small...",
  ],
  "quest.4755482F56F4058B.title": "Choose Your Opponent",
  "quest.4755482F56F4058B.quest_desc": [
    "Go to the arena of trial 3, choose your opponent and answer the king's last question.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E37348514E.title": "Faster than the Mail",
  "quest.475548E37348514E.quest_desc": [
    "Jump into a mail chute on the loading platform in front of the palace and slide to the post office in under 40 seconds.",
  ],
  "quest.4755489579E347D3.title": "The Air Nun",
  "quest.4755489579E347D3.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to the air nun guh in the hanging hall of the Western Air Temple.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484C8EF34C78.title": "Let the Temple Sing",
  "quest.4755484C8EF34C78.quest_desc": [
    "Stand on the balcony at the end of each of the five wind corridors and use your air power there.",
  ],
  "quest.475548EFBFFB21B0.title": "The Stray Herd",
  "quest.475548EFBFFB21B0.quest_desc": [
    "Five sky bison guhs drift lost around the island. Fly to them (on Appa or with your wings) and click them: they fly to their own pen.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484AECCB89D1.title": "Back to the Air Nun",
  "quest.4755484AECCB89D1.quest_desc": [
    "The herd is home and the temple sings. Tell the air nun guh.",
  ],
  "quest.475548223B104367.title": "The Friendly Fire Sage",
  "quest.475548223B104367.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to Shyu, the friendly Fire Sage by the hatch behind the altar.",
  ],
  "quest.4755489C23D6BB22.title": "Five Fire Doors",
  "quest.4755489C23D6BB22.quest_desc": [
    "At the top of the tower, stand before each fire door and use your fire power: light all five locks.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483E3CA71054.title": "The Sanctum",
  "quest.4755483E3CA71054.quest_desc": [
    "The doors are open, just for you. Walk into the sanctum.",
  ],
  "quest.475548424323ED27.title": "Roku Guh",
  "quest.475548424323ED27.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to the spirit of Guhvatar Roku Guh in the sanctum.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481216FCF0F5.title": "The Leader",
  "quest.4755481216FCF0F5.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to the leader of the Kyoshi Warrior Guhs in the dojo.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484A2201DCCD.title": "The Fan Dance",
  "quest.4755484A2201DCCD.quest_desc": [
    "Stand on the golden tile in the middle of the dance floor and follow the calls on the beat: DUCK, JUMP or TURN. Twelve right is enough.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484F555F7BA8.title": "Painted Like a Warrior",
  "quest.4755484F555F7BA8.quest_desc": [
    "Go to the makeup table under the mirror in the dojo (click it, or crouch in front of it).",
  ],
  "quest.475548482494C628.title": "The Biggest Fan",
  "quest.475548482494C628.quest_desc": [
    "Show yourself to the foaming fan guh by the gate.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E099759FE7.title": "The Owl's Rules",
  "quest.475548E099759FE7.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to Wan Shi Guh in the owl hall, at the very bottom of the library.",
  ],
  "quest.47554833C30980E8.title": "A Piece of Knowledge",
  "quest.47554833C30980E8.quest_desc": [
    "Bring Wan Shi Guh three pieces of knowledge: a map, a compass, a clock, a spyglass or a book. Hold it and click him.",
  ],
  "quest.4755482E062506EA.title": "A Book for You",
  "quest.4755482E062506EA.quest_desc": [
    "A fox guh brings the book that suits you. Find one and click it.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E332B34235.title": "The Planetarium",
  "quest.475548E332B34235.quest_desc": [
    "Turn the wheel of the planetarium, next to Professor Zei Guh.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483BDD833ABF.title": "Over the Shell",
  "quest.4755483BDD833ABF.quest_desc": [
    "Walk over the shell of the island to the stone ring at the very top.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480FD9808A2D.title": "The Raised Paw",
  "quest.4755480FD9808A2D.quest_desc": [
    "Go down along his flank and stand on the palm of his raised paw.",
  ],
  "quest.47554866CA8F2D61.title": "A Nibble as an Offering",
  "quest.47554866CA8F2D61.quest_desc": [
    "Hold a cheese nibble and click his snout while you stand on his palm.",
  ],
  "quest.475548ED95DCF284.title": "Four Lasting Chonk Arts",
  "quest.475548ED95DCF284.quest_desc": [
    "Every element you learn in the story of the Guhvatar leaves something lasting: an &6air leap&r (in mid-air too), &6walking on water&r, a little &6earth pillar&r and a &6paw flame&r. One key (by default &dH&r): tap = use, hold = the element wheel.",
  ],
  "quest.475548846B7F300D.title": "A Sighing Cook",
  "quest.475548846B7F300D.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to the Mika cook in the kitchen of a Mika Fortress.",
  ],
  "quest.475548EF06519287.title": "Ingredients",
  "quest.475548EF06519287.quest_desc": [
    "Bring the cook 2 blue cheese mushrooms, 2 crystal cheese nuggets, 2 nibble chorus fruits and 1 crumb cloud from the outer islands.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483610C29FF1.title": "Distract the Captain",
  "quest.4755483610C29FF1.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to the fortress captain on the ground floor and come up with something that works.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BAED7542BD.title": "The Secret Soup",
  "quest.475548BAED7542BD.quest_desc": [
    "Back to the cook in the kitchen.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A807E2530A.title": "A Kitchen of His Own",
  "quest.475548A807E2530A.quest_desc": [
    "Visit the cook in his new kitchen in the Void Harbor: The Sorry Spatula.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484E751BC639.title": "The Note",
  "quest.4755484E751BC639.quest_desc": [
    "Read the note on the harbor board at the pier of a Mika Fortress (click it).",
  ],
  "quest.4755486EBDACD359.title": "To the Shipyard",
  "quest.4755486EBDACD359.quest_desc": [
    "Bring the shipwright guh in the Void Harbor 24 planks, 8 wool, 4 Mika's Grease and 2 flash crumbs. Then he builds your boat.",
  ],
  "quest.475548CE6FC5177F.title": "Christen Your Boat",
  "quest.475548CE6FC5177F.quest_desc": [
    "Your little grease boat is ready. Talk to the shipwright guh and give it a color, a sail and a name.",
  ],
  "quest.47554893C0F629AC.title": "Trading with Ender Mikas",
  "quest.47554893C0F629AC.quest_desc": [
    "On the market of the Void Harbor, Ender Mikas stand behind their stalls. Their offers change every day. Click one to trade.",
  ],
  "quest.47554800DEC3D562.title": "The Chonky Wave",
  "quest.47554800DEC3D562.quest_desc": [
    "The ferry guh in the Void Harbor sails you for free to every place in the Guh End you know, and to the main island.",
  ],
  "quest.475548AD6006E2DD.title": "The Guh Wing Ring Race",
  "quest.475548AD6006E2DD.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to the race master guh on the starting platform, fly through all eighteen rings and land on the landing strip. Under 45 seconds and you become a &dRing Racer&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548200AAB2DA1.title": "Fortress Liberator",
  "quest.475548200AAB2DA1.quest_desc": [
    "Free six skinny guhs from the cells of the Mika Fortresses (give them a nibble). That earns the title &dFortress Liberator&r.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481CB9D16CCF.title": "Where Are We Flying?",
  "quest.4755481CB9D16CCF.quest_desc": [
    "Sit on your &dAppa Guh&r's head and blow the &6Appa Whistle&r. You get a list of every building you know in the Guheinde. Pick one and Appa flies there: you may steer, or let go and he flies himself. Your team rides along on his back.",
  ],
  "quest.475548CC98A7A492.title": "Riding Along on Appa",
  "quest.475548CC98A7A492.quest_desc": [
    "Climb into a friend's Appa Guh &dsaddle basket&r and fly somewhere together. As long as you travel with them you are their &bguest&r: you may go where they may go, and you see their team. Your own story stays your own.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F410D4474E.title": "Dodge Zuka!",
  "quest.475548F410D4474E.quest_desc": [
    "On the way to the next chapter &cZuka's ship&r sometimes shows up. He fires fireballs that only push. Press a movement key when one comes and Appa dives aside. How many can you dodge?",
  ],
  "quest.4755485210EC91BC.title": "The Great Singing One",
  "quest.4755485210EC91BC.quest_desc": [
    "In harbor pub &6The Chonky Whale&r in the &eVoid Harbor&r an old captain guh tells of a whale that sings. The whole pub laughs. Listen to his story... and believe him.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B37C0518EC.title": "Waiting in the Void",
  "quest.475548B37C0518EC.quest_desc": [
    "Fly to the spot the captain named and wait there above the void. Very quietly. First you hear the song...",
  ],
  "quest.4755488C256867F2.title": "Proof for the Pub",
  "quest.4755488C256867F2.quest_desc": [
    "Feed the whale a &5Nibble Chorus Fruit&r and bring the &dVoid Pearl&r to the captain. Now the pub has to believe!",
  ],
  "quest.475548E7961EE6D3.title": "A Whale of Your Own",
  "quest.475548E7961EE6D3.quest_desc": [
    "Feed a whale a Nibble Chorus Fruit eight times. Then he trusts you and becomes yours: blow &6the Captain's Horn&r and he comes, stand on his back with the horn in your hand and he swims where you look.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E1F760F260.title": "A Little House on a Whale",
  "quest.475548E1F760F260.quest_desc": [
    "Sneak and blow the horn: furnish your whale's back. A little house, two chests that really keep items, a bed for a nap, a little garden with Nibble Chorus Fruits, lanterns and a flag in your colour.",
  ],
  "quest.47554853B36716B7.title": "Holey Cheese Hills",
  "quest.47554853B36716B7.quest_desc": [
    "Visit the &6Holey Cheese Hills&r on the outer islands of the Guh End. Rolling yellow hills full of round holes, with a little pond of cheese sauce here and there. Who has been nibbling here?",
  ],
  "quest.47554805D50DEDAC.title": "Rind Desert",
  "quest.47554805D50DEDAC.quest_desc": [
    "Visit the &6Rind Desert&r on the outer islands of the Guh End. Flat, dry and cracked, with dunes of crumb sand that you sink into. Somewhere there is an oasis, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.4755487D3AA3ECF4.title": "Crumb Clouds",
  "quest.4755487D3AA3ECF4.quest_desc": [
    "Visit the &6Crumb Clouds&r on the outer islands of the Guh End. Crumbs that float and clouds you slowly sink through. Watch where you land! This region is small and rare: have a good look around.",
  ],
  "quest.475548260E8335EA.title": "Blue Cheese Plains",
  "quest.475548260E8335EA.quest_desc": [
    "Visit the &6Blue Cheese Plains&r on the outer islands of the Guh End. Blue cheese as far as you can see, mist, ponds and giant mushrooms that glow. It smells... special here. This region is small and rare: have a good look around.",
  ],
  "quest.4755489AAB3712B8.title": "Crystal Cheese Cliffs",
  "quest.4755489AAB3712B8.quest_desc": [
    "Visit the &6Crystal Cheese Cliffs&r on the outer islands of the Guh End. Tall pillars of old cliff cheese with golden crystals on them. This is where the &6crystal cheese&r grows. This region is small and rare: have a good look around.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481479785AC4.title": "Nibble Chorus Forest",
  "quest.4755481479785AC4.quest_desc": [
    "Visit the &6Nibble Chorus Forest&r on the outer islands of the Guh End. Tall purple nibble chorus plants that softly sing. Be quiet and listen: every flower has its own note. This region is small and rare: have a good look around.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D46E709FAB.title": "Cheese with a Golden Edge",
  "quest.475548D46E709FAB.quest_desc": [
    "In the Crystal Cheese Cliffs there is &6crystal cheese ore&r in the cliff cheese, and golden crystals grow on the pillars. Mine some &6crystal cheese&r. Nine nuggets make a whole one too. (Not for eating: it is far too hard for that.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548D6CC0341A8.title": "Floop!",
  "quest.475548D6CC0341A8.quest_desc": [
    "Chop down a nibble chorus plant and eat a &dnibble chorus fruit&r. Floop: suddenly you stand a little further on. Handy near a cliff. Or not at all, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F9822BE5AD.title": "Popped Is Tasty Too",
  "quest.475548F9822BE5AD.quest_desc": [
    "Put a nibble chorus fruit in the furnace: it pops open. Four &dpopped nibble chorus fruits&r make four nibble chorus blocks, and those make stairs, slabs and pillars.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481C21C11078.title": "A Little Light for Your Guh",
  "quest.4755481C21C11078.quest_desc": [
    "A popped nibble chorus fruit on a guh crystal: four &dlight rods&r. Now the Guh End is never completely dark again.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D84B9AE10E.title": "Cheese With a Rind",
  "quest.475548D84B9AE10E.quest_desc": [
    "In the &6Holey Cheese Hills&r of the Guh End the &6Rind Guhs&r roll around: holey-cheese yellow, with a shield of rind. Tame one with cheese nibbles. Sneak next to him and he rolls up into a little ball you can push away. Nyeg, he likes it!",
  ],
  "quest.475548CEE65ECAF0.title": "Just the Ears",
  "quest.475548CEE65ECAF0.quest_desc": [
    "In the dry &6Rind Desert&r lives the &6Dune Guh&r, with ears you could make a sail out of. Tame one. Let him stand still on &7crumb sand&r and he digs himself in: only his little ears still stick out.",
  ],
  "quest.475548AEAF6A3954.title": "Lighter Than a Crumb",
  "quest.475548AEAF6A3954.quest_desc": [
    "High up in the &6Crumb Clouds&r the &6Crumb Guh&r drifts from island to island. He simply stands on the crumb clouds you sink through, and floats down ever so slowly. Tame one!",
  ],
  "quest.4755481074B8D283.title": "A Lamp on Little Legs",
  "quest.4755481074B8D283.quest_desc": [
    "Something is glowing in the mist of the &6Blue Cheese Plains&r. It is a &6Blue Cheese Guh&r: blue-veined cheese with little mushrooms. Tame one and you will never need a torch again: he glows like a lamp and walks along with you.",
  ],
  "quest.47554826934AB4E3.title": "A Nose for Shinies",
  "quest.47554826934AB4E3.quest_desc": [
    "On the &6Crystal Cheese Cliffs&r the &6Crystal Guh&r glitters, with a little crown of cheese crystal. Tame one. Now and then he sniffs up a &6Crystal Cheese Nugget&r for you: one a day at most, so make it last.",
  ],
  "quest.475548762616D09E.title": "First Voice: Nyeg",
  "quest.475548762616D09E.quest_desc": [
    "Among the singing plants of the &6Nibble Chorus Forest&r one of them sings back: the &6Chorus Guh&r, choir collar and all. Tame one, put on a &7music disc&r and listen. Nyeg-nyeg-nyeeeeg!",
  ],
  "quest.475548D40EDC0FD6.title": "Six Lands, Six Friends",
  "quest.475548D40EDC0FD6.quest_desc": [
    "Every land of the outer islands has its own guh. Tame all six: the &6Rind Guh&r, the &6Dune Guh&r, the &6Crumb Guh&r, the &6Blue Cheese Guh&r, the &6Crystal Guh&r and the &6Chorus Guh&r. Each gets a page of its own in your Guhdex.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B4376A3CA0.title": "Ender Mika",
  "quest.475548B4376A3CA0.quest_desc": [
    "On the &5outer islands&r of the Guh End, tall, thin, purple-black Mikas stand staring into the void. Look at them and they shyly &dflit&r away. Get close (just for a moment) for your Guhdex. And mind your &6cheese nibbles&r: hold one in your hand and it swipes one. Stare right at it for two seconds and you get it back!",
  ],
  "quest.47554807581C62D4.title": "Flash Crumb",
  "quest.47554807581C62D4.quest_desc": [
    "An Ender Mika is a real Mika: whack it and it shoves back. Sometimes it leaves a &dFlash Crumb&r behind, a crumb that still flickers a little. Keep it safe, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481CB9AB65EB.title": "Cheese Mite",
  "quest.4755481CB9AB65EB.quest_desc": [
    "Eat a &5nibble chorus fruit&r and sometimes... pop! Out jumps a &echeese mite&r, a teeny-tiny crumb critter that tickles your toes. That gives you the &ehiccups&r. Ender Mikas trail after it dreamily and forget all about your nibbles.",
  ],
  "quest.47554806DC2A1289.title": "Hidey Guh",
  "quest.47554806DC2A1289.quest_desc": [
    "Little round cheese boxes hang on the walls of a &5Mika Fortress&r. Come closer calmly and a &dHidey Guh&r peeks out from under the little lid. An empty hand: you get a &dsmooch&r and float for a moment. Don't worry, you land softly.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485CBCF10D62.title": "Box Shell",
  "quest.4755485CBCF10D62.quest_desc": [
    "Give a Hidey Guh a &6cheese nibble&r: it pushes out a &ebox shell&r. It does that once a day, so find more than one (or come back tomorrow).",
  ],
  "quest.475548EFBFE1D433.title": "Hidey Box",
  "quest.475548EFBFE1D433.quest_desc": [
    "A box shell, a &6chest&r and another box shell, one under the other: a &dHidey Box&r. It keeps everything that is inside, even when you pick it up. A whole chest full in one slot. WAHOOG!",
  ],
  "quest.47554853F4D5793F.title": "Crumb Jellies",
  "quest.47554853F4D5793F.quest_desc": [
    "Above the &eCrumb Clouds&r, swarms of &6Crumb Jellies&r drift by: glowing little jellyfish of cheese crumbs. Get close for your Guhdex. And try dropping onto one: &dBOING!&r (Sneak, and you sink through.)",
  ],
  "quest.4755487E247ECC2E.title": "A Lamp That Looks Back",
  "quest.4755487E247ECC2E.quest_desc": [
    "Scoop up a Crumb Jelly with a &bglass bottle&r: you get a &6Crumb Jelly Jar&r, a lamp you put down or hang up. Break the jar and the jelly floats around freely again (and stays with you).",
  ],
  "quest.475548A9F00BDC3A.title": "Napping Upside Down",
  "quest.475548A9F00BDC3A.quest_desc": [
    "In the &eCrumb Clouds&r, every once in a while a &dBat-Lemur Guh&r flutters by: big ears, ringed tail, skin wings. It likes to sleep hanging upside down. Sneak closer for your Guhdex and give it an apple.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484B866D6CF8.title": "Belly Sliding",
  "quest.4755484B866D6CF8.quest_desc": [
    "On the &bBlue Cheese Plains&r an &dOtter-Penguin Guh&r sometimes waddles around. On ice and snow it slides on its belly! Get close for your Guhdex. It likes a little fish.",
  ],
  "quest.475548360D83FBB8.title": "It Feels You Coming",
  "quest.475548360D83FBB8.quest_desc": [
    "In the &6Crystal Cheese Cliffs&r the odd &dBadger-Mole Guh&r digs away. It is blind, but it feels your steps (sneak!). In soft ground it tunnels around without breaking a single block. Get close for your Guhdex.",
  ],
  "quest.47554827FF086DFC.title": "Quack-Nyeg",
  "quest.47554827FF086DFC.quest_desc": [
    "In the &5Nibble Chorus Forest&r a &dTurtle-Duck Guh&r bobs along now and then: a duckling in a turtle shell. Hold &6bread&r and it follows you everywhere. Get close for your Guhdex.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485707A6ACE1.title": "A Fortress Full of Towers",
  "quest.4755485707A6ACE1.quest_desc": [
    "The &dMika Fortresses&r of the outer islands have grown: a keep with a guard room, a kitchen and a throne room, bridges to side towers that float on a point, and at the pier a &6grease ship&r. Find one (the Super Compass points the way) and walk in. Every fortress is different, nyeg!",
  ],
  "quest.475548E68B036FA5.title": "A Sleepover at Mika's",
  "quest.475548E68B036FA5.quest_desc": [
    "Behind the keep stands the &dcell block&r: \"the guest wing\", the Mikas call it. There are skinny guhs inside. Give one a &6cheese nibble&r through the door: WAHOOG! Every player can free every guh once.",
  ],
  "quest.475548EAE15A258B.title": "Six Empty Cells",
  "quest.475548EAE15A258B.quest_desc": [
    "Free &6six&r skinny guhs from the cells of Mika Fortresses. The cell block holds six, and a dungeon tower (\"the guest room\") two more. The Mikas don't get it: weren't the keys eaten?",
  ],
  "quest.4755487D45B59819.title": "Find Omashguh",
  "quest.4755487D45B59819.quest_desc": [
    "Above the &6Crystal Cheese Cliffs&r floats a mountain town of cliff cheese: &6Omashguh&r. The mail does not walk there, the mail &oslides&r: from the palace of King Bumi Guh all the way down to the post office. You may too, nyeg. (The Super Compass knows the way: tab End.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548CDE98316BF.title": "Find the Western Air Temple",
  "quest.475548CDE98316BF.quest_desc": [
    "Above the &6Crumb Clouds&r floats an island with nothing but some grass and a fountain. Take a look &ounder&r the island: there hangs the &6Western Air Temple&r, upside down. The entrance is the cellar stairs. The bison stable is empty: the herd has been missing for a while.",
  ],
  "quest.47554838803BAAC0.title": "Find the Fire Temple of Roku Guh",
  "quest.47554838803BAAC0.quest_desc": [
    "Above the &6Nibble Chorus Forest&r floats an island shaped like a crescent moon, with a red pagoda on it: the &6Fire Temple of Roku Guh&r. All the way at the top are five fire doors side by side. They are shut. Knocking does not help, but it is polite.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488735CCDD7C.title": "Find the Void Harbor",
  "quest.4755488735CCDD7C.quest_desc": [
    "Somewhere between the outer islands a whole &6harbor&r floats in the nothing: jetties with Grease Ships moored to them, a market with Ender Mikas behind the stalls, a ferry pier, a shipyard and a pub. The Super Compass (the End tab) shows the way. Land on the deck with the little pink nose.",
  ],
  "quest.475548AB8D2D044A.title": "Find Kyoshi Village",
  "quest.475548AB8D2D044A.quest_desc": [
    "Above the Blue Cheese Plains floats a village with sea-green roofs, and towering over it all is a &6giant statue of Kyoshi Guh&r: white face paint, golden fans, very big feet. There is a dance floor in the dojo. The warrior guhs must have just stepped out, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A01F3BD331.title": "Find Wan Shi Guh's Library",
  "quest.475548A01F3BD331.quest_desc": [
    "In the Rind Desert a green spire sticks out of the sand. That is all you see. The rest of the &6library&r hangs underneath: six halls deep, full of books. The entrance is the window. Really.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A73C3D36BC.title": "Find Lion Turtle Island",
  "quest.475548A73C3D36BC.quest_desc": [
    "An island with a forest on it. And a tail. And a head with a mane and guh ears. This island &6is someone&r: a Lion Turtle Guh, so old he forgot how old. Walk along his arm to the palm of his hand and say hello nicely.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D9018EFF87.title": "Find the Guh Wing Ring Race",
  "quest.475548D9018EFF87.quest_desc": [
    "In the Crumb Clouds hangs a course of &6eighteen glowing rings&r: out along the north side, around the turn, back along the south side. Start tower, landing strip, scoreboard: all set. Only the race master has yet to show up. Practicing is allowed.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DCC194C801.title": "Bikini Bottom Under the Void",
  "quest.475548DCC194C801.quest_desc": [
    "Deep between the outer islands of the Guh End lies a dish of cheese rind under a gigantic &dsoap bubble&r: &6Bikini Bottom&r. The Super Compass (the end tab) points the way. Land on the little island above it and step into the &bbubble stream&r: it sets you down neatly on the square. The purple mist is not water, so just keep breathing. Who lives there? You will notice soon enough. Somebody there laughs very loudly, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B44B8692E1.title": "The Road to Shell City",
  "quest.475548B44B8692E1.quest_desc": [
    "A road runs from the gate of &dBikini Bottom&r into the void. Follow it: past &6The Thug Tug&r (a tugboat full of tough Mikas, and don't you dare blow bubbles in there), straight through &8the Trench&r (deep, dark, full of monsters, have fun) and then down the hill to &bShell City&r on the Void Sea. That is where the Cyclops has his gift shop. Everything in it is dried, nyeg.",
  ],
}
